-- Mounts ported from the 4Classic client (Tools/ClassicPort — generated, do not edit by hand).
--
-- TMOUNTCHART: mount -> plain / saddled recall monster.
-- TMONSTERCHART: the recall monsters, cloned from Brown Horse (31025 plain / 31100 saddled).
-- TITEMCHART: the items that make the mounts, cloned from 30261 with the client-file fields overwritten
--             (same technique and column list as 006_titemchart_missing_mountpet_items.sql).
